<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">M3ET: Efficient Vision-Language Learning for Robotics based on Multimodal Mamba-Enhanced Transformer
<br class="ltx_break">
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span><sup id="id19" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> Corresponding author.</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
